            "notes": "# Power\nThis really depend if you want to be more flanky and get out like playing  [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) or do you want to be more sustain and playing continuely\n\nI recommend playing continuous which you should aim at third round power for  [Cyclic Salvo](item_624ac709-635c-418c-9848-52720e2bba70) then  [Heat Seekers](item_42f6c4c6-3420-4133-a2f5-d3805db39ebb) on round 5\n\nIf you want to be more flanky and confirm kill, I recommend buying  [Heat Seekers](item_42f6c4c6-3420-4133-a2f5-d3805db39ebb) \n\n# Items\n\nBy round 3-4 you should try to get  [Ana's Aim Assist](item_a0296526-119f-454d-a2dc-de4105f12498) which should allow you to heal about 60 health at that time\n\nThen buy [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) to replace  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da)\n\nIf you want to playing more flanky and have more money, sell  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) to buy  [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) and  [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1)\n\nIf you want to be more sustain, instead of getting  [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1), buy  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48)",
